      "id": "claim_07701f7dd3b74c33ab4576945972fe2c",
      "statement": "BaseCallbackManager and its subclasses CallbackManager and AsyncCallbackManager manage handler lifecycle, maintain handler lists (handlers and inheritable_handlers), propagate context (tags, metadata, parent_run_id), and provide add/remove/set operations for handlers, tags, and metadata with optional inheritance control; start events return specialized run managers (CallbackManagerForLLMRun, CallbackManagerForChainRun, CallbackManagerForToolRun, CallbackManagerForRetrieverRun) bound to specific operations.",
